  "summary_en": "EESC opinion welcoming the Commission's 2021 revised Coordinated Plan on AI. It supports investment, data infrastructure, skills, sandboxes, social dialogue and trustworthy, explicable, sustainable AI. Robotics appears only as a high-impact sector, with a brief mention of care robots.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Welcomes the revised coordinated plan and calls for expedited implementation",
   "Calls for ongoing monitoring of progress using performance indicators",
   "Trust requires explicability of algorithms and a right to challenge algorithmic decisions",
   "Supports regulatory sandboxes and SME-focused innovation hubs and funding",
   "Calls for social dialogue on automation and its effects on workers"
